{"sectionId":"reproduction/gametes","items":[{"id":"reproduction--gametes-k001","sectionId":"reproduction/gametes","unitId":"reproduction","subject":"biology","text":"감수분열 I은 상동염색체, II는 자매 염색분체의 분리다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"reproduction--gametes-k002","sectionId":"reproduction/gametes","unitId":"reproduction","subject":"biology","text":"DNA 복제는 감수분열 I 전에 한 번 일어난다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"reproduction--gametes-k003","sectionId":"reproduction/gametes","unitId":"reproduction","subject":"biology","text":"사람의 일차 난모세포는 전기 I에서 정지하고 배란 무렵 감수분열 I을 완료하며 이차 난모세포는 중기 II에 정지한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"reproduction--gametes-k004","sectionId":"reproduction/gametes","unitId":"reproduction","subject":"biology","text":"수정 후 감수분열 II가 완료된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"reproduction--gametes-k005","sectionId":"reproduction/gametes","unitId":"reproduction","subject":"biology","text":"정자형성은 정원세포 증식, 감수분열 및 정자변태를 거친다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"reproduction--gametes-k006","sectionId":"reproduction/gametes","unitId":"reproduction","subject":"biology","text":"GnRH의 박동성 분비는 FSH와 LH 분비를 유도한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"reproduction--gametes-k007","sectionId":"reproduction/gametes","unitId":"reproduction","subject":"biology","text":"난소에서 LH는 theca 세포 안드로겐 합성, FSH는 granulosa 세포 aromatase를 통한 에스트로겐 합성에 기여한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"reproduction--gametes-k008","sectionId":"reproduction/gametes","unitId":"reproduction","subject":"biology","text":"지속적으로 높은 에스트라디올은 배란 전 LH surge를 유도한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"reproduction--gametes-k009","sectionId":"reproduction/gametes","unitId":"reproduction","subject":"biology","text":"황체는 progesterone을 분비하고 자궁내막을 분비기로 유지한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"reproduction--gametes-k010","sectionId":"reproduction/gametes","unitId":"reproduction","subject":"biology","text":"임신 초기 hCG는 황체 기능을 유지한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"reproduction--gametes-k011","sectionId":"reproduction/gametes","unitId":"reproduction","subject":"biology","text":"남성에서 LH는 Leydig 세포 testosterone 생성, FSH는 Sertoli 세포 기능 및 정자형성을 지원한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"reproduction--gametes-k012","sectionId":"reproduction/gametes","unitId":"reproduction","subject":"biology","text":"inhibin은 FSH 조절에 관여한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"reproduction--gametes-k013","sectionId":"reproduction/gametes","unitId":"reproduction","subject":"biology","text":"LH surge가 배란을 유도한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"reproduction--gametes-k014","sectionId":"reproduction/gametes","unitId":"reproduction","subject":"biology","text":"Sertoli: 정자 지지·inhibin, Leydig: testosterone.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"reproduction--gametes-k015","sectionId":"reproduction/gametes","unitId":"reproduction","subject":"biology","text":"배란된 사람 난자는 보통 중기 II의 이차 난모세포다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"reproduction--gametes-k016","sectionId":"reproduction/gametes","unitId":"reproduction","subject":"biology","text":"hCG는 LH 수용체를 자극한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"reproduction--gametes-k017","sectionId":"reproduction/gametes","unitId":"reproduction","subject":"biology","text":"Progesterone이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]}]}